# Cognito Docs - Coding Standards

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js with App Router
- **Documentation**: Fumadocs (MDX-based)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Language**: TypeScript

## Project Structure
- `content/docs/` - MDX documentation files
- `src/app/` - Next.js App Router pages
- `src/components/diagrams/` - Custom diagram React components
- `src/lib/source.ts` - Fumadocs source configuration
- `src/mdx-components.tsx` - MDX component registry
- `public/` - Static assets (images)

## MDX Content Rules

### Code Blocks
- **CRITICAL**: Use `bash` for shell commands; `env` is NOT supported by Shiki
- Add titles: ` ```bash title="Terminal" `
- Supported languages: `typescript`, `bash`, `json`, `mdx`, `tsx`

### Callouts
- **CRITICAL**: Use `<Callout>` component from Fumadocs
- **CRITICAL**: Do NOT use GitHub-style alerts (`> [!NOTE]`, `> [!TIP]`)
- Types: `info` (default), `warn`, `error`
- Do NOT add redundant `title="Note"` when type already shows it

```mdx
<Callout>Info callout.</Callout>
<Callout type="warn">Warning callout.</Callout>
<Callout type="error">Error callout.</Callout>
```

### Sequence Diagrams
- **CRITICAL**: Use React components from `src/components/diagrams/`
- **CRITICAL**: Do NOT use Mermaid syntax in MDX
- **CRITICAL**: Do NOT use images for diagrams that can be components

```mdx
import { ServerToolsSequence } from '@/components/diagrams/ServerToolsSequence';
<ServerToolsSequence />
```

### Images
- Use `<ImageZoom>` for **all images** (diagrams, screenshots, architecture)
- Place images in `public/` directory
- Reference with leading `/`

```mdx
import { ImageZoom } from 'fumadocs-ui/components/image-zoom';
<ImageZoom src="/diagram.png" alt="Description" width={800} height={500} />
```

### File Trees
- Use `<Files>`, `<Folder>`, `<File>` for directory structures

```mdx
import { File, Folder, Files } from 'fumadocs-ui/components/files';
<Files>
  <Folder name="src" defaultOpen>
    <File name="index.ts" />
  </Folder>
</Files>
```

## Writing Style
- Use simple words: "use" not "utilize", "help" not "facilitate"
- Remove filler: No "please", "you can", "you may"
- Subject first: Place subject at beginning of sentences
- Short paragraphs: Max 10-12 words/line, 9 lines/paragraph
- Use tables for conditions/properties
- Use **bold** for key terms

## TypeScript and Imports
- Use path alias `@/*` for `./src/*`
- Group imports at top of file
- Prefer named exports

## Component Development
- Create diagram components in `src/components/diagrams/`
- Register new components in `src/mdx-components.tsx`
- Use TypeScript for all components

## Available MDX Components
Registered in `src/mdx-components.tsx`:
- `Callout` - Notes, tips, warnings
- `ImageZoom` - Zoomable images (use for ALL images)
- `Tab`, `Tabs` - Tabbed content
- `Accordion`, `Accordions` - Collapsible sections
- `File`, `Folder`, `Files` - File tree displays
- Diagram components: `ServerToolsSequence`, `StdioMcpSequence`, `OAuthFlowSequence`, `McpOAuthSequence`, `McpToolApprovalSequence`, `McpToolExecutionSequence`, `McpConnectionStatesDiagram`

## Navigation
- Edit `meta.json` files to update navigation
- Frontmatter required: `title`, `description`

## Commands
```bash
pnpm dev:docs      # Start dev server (port 3003)
pnpm build         # Build for production
pnpm types:check   # Type check
```
